# example.com/full

- trilha 0.0.0 · 8 routes (6 pages, 2 APIs)
- trilha_gen.go: missing
- app/setup.go: Setup, Config

## Routes

- `GET /` — app/page.go · layouts: app/layout.go · middleware: app/middleware.go
- `GET /admin` — app/admin/page.go · layouts: app/layout.go · middleware: app/middleware.go, app/admin/middleware.go
- `DELETE GET POST /api/posts` — app/api/posts/route.go · middleware: app/middleware.go
- `GET /api/posts/{id}` — app/api/posts/id_/route.go · middleware: app/middleware.go
- `GET /blog` — app/blog/page.go · layouts: app/blog/layout.go, app/layout.go · middleware: app/middleware.go
- `GET POST /blog/novo` — app/blog/novo/page.go · layouts: app/blog/layout.go, app/layout.go · middleware: app/middleware.go
- `GET /blog/{slug}` — app/blog/slug_/page.go · layouts: app/blog/layout.go, app/layout.go · middleware: app/middleware.go
- `GET /docs/{path...}` — app/docs/path__/page.go · layouts: app/layout.go · middleware: app/middleware.go

